    {
      "source": "<code>Mono</code> that emits a <code>HandlerResult</code>, or completes\nempty if the request is fully handled; any error signal would not be\nhandled within the <a href=\"../DispatcherHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>DispatcherHandler</code></a>, and would instead be\nprocessed by the chain of registered\n<a href=\"../../server/WebExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebExceptionHandler</code></a>s at the end\nof the <a href=\"../../server/WebFilter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebFilter</code></a> chain",
      "translation": "发出 `HandlerResult` 的 `<code>Mono</code>`，或者在请求完全处理后空完成；任何错误信号都不会在 <a href=\"../DispatcherHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>DispatcherHandler</code></a> 中处理，而是将由注册在 <a href=\"../../server/WebFilter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebFilter</code></a> 链末尾的 <a href=\"../../server/WebExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebExceptionHandler</code></a>s 链进行处理。",
      "count": 2
