    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../HandlerResult.html#setExceptionHandler(org.springframework.web.reactive.DispatchExceptionHandler)\"><code>Set an exception handler</code></a> on the returned <code>HandlerResult</code> to handle\ndeferred exceptions from asynchronous return values, and to handle\nexceptions from response rendering.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../HandlerResult.html#setExceptionHandler(org.springframework.web.reactive.DispatchExceptionHandler)\"><code>设置异常处理器</code></a> 到返回的 <code>HandlerResult</code>，以处理异步返回值中的延迟异常以及响应渲染中的异常。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>handler</code> - the selected handler which must have been previously\nchecked via <a href=\"../HandlerAdapter.html#supports(java.lang.Object)\"><code>HandlerAdapter.supports(Object)</code></a>",
