      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implement <a href=\"../DispatchExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>DispatchExceptionHandler</code></a> to extend exception\nhandling to exceptions that occur before a handler is selected.",
      "translation": "实现<a href=\"../DispatchExceptionHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>DispatchExceptionHandler</code></a>以扩展异常处理范围，涵盖在选定处理器之前发生的异常。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations should consider the following for exception handling:",
      "translation": "实现应考虑以下异常处理事项：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../HandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>HandlerAdapter</code></a> that allows using the plain <a href=\"../../server/WebHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebHandler</code></a> contract\nwith the generic <a href=\"../DispatcherHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>DispatcherHandler</code></a>.",
      "translation": "允许使用普通的<a href=\"../../server/WebHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebHandler</code></a>契约与通用的<a href=\"../DispatcherHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>DispatcherHandler</code></a>一起使用的<a href=\"../HandlerAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive\"><code>HandlerAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle the request with the given handler, previously checked via\n<a href=\"../HandlerAdapter.html#supports(java.lang.Object)\"><code>HandlerAdapter.supports(Object)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定处理器处理请求，该处理器此前已通过 <a href=\"../HandlerAdapter.html#supports(java.lang.Object)\"><code>HandlerAdapter.supports(Object)</code></a> 检查。",
      "count": 1
